### [13:36:30 UTC] Step 5/6 — Coherence measurements + spectral deviation score
Input: input_test.flac (reference, 308700 Hz, 2 ch, 15.1373 s), output_test.flac (176400 Hz), input_test.mp3 (44100 Hz, 192 kbps -> original Nyquist 22050 Hz). Scripts: /tmp/aqc/score.py, /tmp/aqc/extra.py.
Action: Ran the rules' fixed algorithm (resample_poly 7/4 output -> 308700 Hz, trim to min length, scipy.signal.stft nperseg=2048 noverlap=1024, per-spectrogram max-normalize) plus all Coherence-score checks and two supplementary checks (frame-RMS dynamic range, persistent-tone hunt) targeting the cycle-4 static-drone defect.
Reasoning: Task steps 5-7; the supplementary checks exist because prior cycles found a constant 98 Hz drone and collapsed quiet-passage dynamic range.
Output:
  invalid samples: 0 non-finite.
  clipping: 0.0129% of samples |x|>0.999 after peak-normalize (raw peak exactly 1.000000, as toggle_normalize=True intends).
  above-original-Nyquist (22050-88200 Hz, native output rate): peak -176.3 dB rel in-band peak, rms -143.9 dB rel in-band rms -- at/below the FFT noise floor. (Reference input_test.flac itself carries -55.3 dB of legacy artifacts up there; the output does not.)
  dropouts: 0 near-zero runs >50 ms (so 0 unmatched).
  discontinuities: 99.9th pct |diff| out=0.0161 vs ref=0.0582 (ratio 0.277); max |diff| out=0.0428 vs ref=0.2522 -- output is smoother than the reference, no click/pop proxy.
  gain-matched band energy (out vs ref): 0-500 Hz -0.00 dB, 500-2k +0.01, 2k-5k +0.11, 5k-10k +0.37, 10k-14k +1.03, 14k-16k +1.67, 16k-18k +2.24, 18k-20k +2.55, 20k-22.05k +3.32 (both at ~-127 dB, i.e. noise floor). Band-selective HF lift, flat at LF -> not a broadband noise-floor rise; but the one genuinely empty band (20-22.05 kHz) stayed at the noise floor, so no clearly new content there.
  dynamic range (50 ms frame RMS, p99/p05): ref 30.6 dB vs out 30.7 dB; envelope correlation 1.00000; quietest 5% of frames +0.0 dB vs reference -> the cycle-4 static floor/drone is gone. Persistent-tone hunt (8192-pt STFT, 20-2000 Hz): no bin present in more than 73% of frames, and the top bins are real bass content, not a constant tone.
  spectral deviation: convergence=0.9839, correlation=0.9999, combined=0.9919 -> score 9.9.

